  81:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_FftF32.c ****     /*Perform in place Ifx_FftF32_radix2DecimationInTime of 2^p points (=size of f)
  82:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_FftF32.c ****      * N.B. The input array f is in bit reversed order! So all the
  83:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_FftF32.c ****      * 'even' input samples are in the 'top' half, all the 'odd'
  84:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_FftF32.c ****      * input samples are in the 'bottom' halR..etc (recursively).
  85:../Libraries/Service/Tricore/Math/Ifx_FftF32.c ****      */
